          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 8: Folio 1v, right side",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">eylese, sehv-i secde</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ide. Fa\u0304tih\u0323a&rsquo;dan evvel</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ok\u0323usa su\u0304renin ba\u02bfz\u0307\u0131s\u0131n\u0131</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ya bir h\u0323arfini sehv-i secde</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ide. Farz\u0307da evvelki</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>oturmada oturmad\u0131ysa</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sehv-i secde ide.</p>\n</li>\n<li>ayak\u0323 (bottom left)</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
