      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 9: Folio 1v, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>If you leave out standing upright,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>bowing, or the two prostrations,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and you remember in the course</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of the prayer or following sala\u0304m</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and add a rak\u02bfa,</p>\n</li>\n<li>your prayer</li>\n<li>is invalid.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
